大夫，侍中、中軍如故。元日朝會萬國，亮辭疾不登殿，設饌別省，而語笑自若。數日，詔公卿問訊，亮無疾色，御史中丞樂藹奏大不敬，論棄市刑。詔削爵廢爲庶人。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004:m0227"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-nan023-wangliang-m6-48","person_id":"591_360_8ca_*****A","title":"御史中丞","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nan023-wangliang-m6-48:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangliang:p006:m0052","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangliang:p006","surface":"御史中丞","start":48,"end":52}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangliang-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangliang","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangliang:p006","quote":"天監二年，轉左光祿大夫。元日朝會，亮辭疾不登殿，設饌別省，語笑自若。數日，詔公卿問訊，亮無病色。御史中丞樂藹奏亮大不敬，論棄市。詔削爵，廢為庶人。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangliang:p006:m0052"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004","text":"義師至新林，內外百僚皆道迎，其未能拔者，亦間路送誠款，亮獨不遣。及城內旣定，獨推亮爲首。亮出見高祖，高祖曰：「顛而不扶，安用彼相。」而弗之罪也。霸府開，以爲大司馬長史、撫軍將軍、琅邪、清河二郡太守。梁臺建，授侍中、尚書令，固讓不拜，乃爲侍中、中書監，兼尚書令。高祖受禪，遷侍中、尚書令、中軍將軍，引參佐命，封豫寧縣公，邑二千戶。天監二年，轉左光祿大夫，侍中、中軍如故。元日朝會萬國，亮辭疾不登殿，設饌別省，而語笑自若。數日，詔公卿問訊，亮無疾色，御史中丞樂藹奏大不敬，論棄市刑。詔削爵廢爲庶人。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":17,"last_line":17,"raw_start":603,"raw_end":857,"raw_character_offsets":[603,604,605,606,607,608,609,610,611,612,613,614,615,616,617,618,619,620,621,6